17. FIND DUPLICATE EMAIL RECORDS
============================================================

Input

Customer

Id | Email
---+------------
1  | a@gmail.com
2  | b@gmail.com
3  | a@gmail.com
4  | c@gmail.com

Query

SELECT Email,
       COUNT(*) AS DuplicateCount
FROM Customer
GROUP BY Email
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;

Output

Email       | DuplicateCount
------------+---------------
a@gmail.com | 2

Explanation

GROUP BY creates one group for every email address.
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1 returns email addresses appearing more than once.

